     ## Analysis Workflow (Ready to Execute)                                    
                                                                                
     Once you pick a dataset, the workflow is:                                  
                                                                                
     ```bash                                                                    
     # Step 1: Convert to .raw format                                           
     bash                                                                       
     /workspace/pigbole/.piggpa/skills/piggpa-G/genomic-selection/scripts/m     
     akerawfile.sh \                                                            
       --bfile <dataset_prefix> \                                               
       --out <output_prefix>                                                    
                                                                                
     # Step 2: Run 6-model comparison (default: 10-fold CV)                     
     Rscript                                                                    
     /workspace/pigbole/.piggpa/skills/piggpa-G/genomic-selection/scripts/G     
     S6models.R \                                                               
       --input <output_prefix>.raw \                                            
       --outdir <output_dir> \                                                  
       --folds 10 \                                                             
       --bglr_iter 1000 --bglr_burnin 500                                       
     ```                                                                        
                                                                                
     **Output you'll get:**                                                     
     - `model_comparison.csv` — Mean r / RMSE / MAE for each model              
     - `model_comparison.pdf/png` — Bar chart with error bars                   
     - `summary.txt` / `summary-zh.txt` — Best-model report with composite      
     scores                                                                     
                                                                                
     **Scoring:** 50% correlation + 25% RMSE + 15% MAE + 10% stability =        
     composite rank.                                                            
                                                                                
